    "description": {
      "value": "You create a dome of brilliant light that destroys projectiles attempting to pass through it. Ammunition from physical ranged attacks-such as arrows, bolts, sling bullets, and other objects of similar size-is destroyed in a flash of light when it passes into or out of the globe's area. Attackers targeting creatures or objects through the globe's surface with physical ranged attacks must succeed at a Fortitude save or become dazzled for 1 round (blinded for 1 round on a critical failure)."
